{"t":"Scrying Ball","s":"scrying-ball-b51a9","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Scrying_Ball_608647.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Scrying Ball</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Scrying Ball\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scrying_Ball_608647.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Other Objects<br/>Quest Objects</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20141223203039&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scrying_Ball_608647.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a scrying ball.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Elvenbane\">Elvenbane</a> tower (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32592,31645,2\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32592, 31645, 2)</a>), and in the tower of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Palace%20Antechambers\">Zao Palace Antechambers</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33155,31297,3\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33155, 31297, 3)</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>These orbs can be used to foretell the future and make one extremely powerful in armed conflicts.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ball\">Crystal Ball</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ball%20%28Immobile%29\">Crystal Ball (Object)</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mago%20Mechanic%20Core\">Mago Mechanic Core</a>.<br/><br/>Destroyed in the <a href=\"#/quest/to-blind-the-enemy-quest\">To Blind the Enemy Quest</a> and the <a href=\"#/quest/an-uneasy-alliance-quest\">An Uneasy Alliance Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/an-uneasy-alliance-quest\">An Uneasy Alliance Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ball\">Crystal Ball</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ball%20%28Immobile%29\">Crystal Ball (Immobile)</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mago%20Mechanic%20Core\">Mago Mechanic Core</a></li><li>Other Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/to-blind-the-enemy-quest\">To Blind the Enemy Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["an-uneasy-alliance-quest","to-blind-the-enemy-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"an-uneasy-alliance-quest","quest":"An Uneasy Alliance Quest","step":"1-5","n":15,"title":"Destruir a Scrying Ball","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"to-blind-the-enemy-quest","quest":"To Blind the Enemy Quest","step":"1-2","n":4,"title":"Usar o espelho","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"spots":[{"x":32592,"y":31645,"z":2,"text":"In the Elvenbane tower ( here ), and in the tower of the Zao Palace Antechambers ( here )."},{"x":33155,"y":31297,"z":3,"text":"In the Elvenbane tower ( here ), and in the tower of the Zao Palace Antechambers ( here )."}]}}